flowchart TB
  accTitle: Advance a polling checkpoint after a complete successful window
  accDescr: Read the last committed checkpoint, query a bounded overlapping window and process every page by UUID. Fetch more pages until the window is complete, then save the new checkpoint. On a query or processing failure, retain the previous checkpoint and retry idempotently. Periodic reconciliation is still required for changes that disappear from the query scope.
  S["Last committed checkpoint"] --> Q["Query bounded window<br/>with overlap · current page"]
  Q --> P["Apply page by UUID<br/>Updates · removals · expiry"]
  P --> M{"More pages?"}
  M -->|"Yes · next page"| Q
  M -->|"No · entire window applied"| C["Commit new checkpoint"]
  Q -->|"Request fails"| R["Keep previous checkpoint<br/>Retry with backoff"]
  P -->|"Processing fails"| R
  R -. "Restart from saved progress" .-> Q
  class S,Q,P,M accent;
  class C success;
  class R caution;
